# Maven build output
target/
**/target/

# Node.js build output and dependencies
**/node_modules/
openapi-skill-node/dist/
openapi-skill-node/*.tgz
# Exception: the consumer testbed pins one packed tarball in its lockfile. That
# tarball must exist in a fresh clone or `npm ci` fails (reported misleadingly as
# "tarball data ... seems to be corrupted", then ENOENT). `npm pack` is only
# byte-reproducible from an LF checkout, so the pinned artifact is committed
# rather than rebuilt. Update this path when the pinned version changes.
!openapi-skill-node/openapi-skill-2.1.1.tgz

